WEBVTT

00:00.710 --> 00:01.480
What the...

00:02.980 --> 00:04.870
I made you lunch.

00:04.870 --> 00:08.660
I heard you like raw meat and garlic, so...

00:08.660 --> 00:10.240
Who told you that?!

00:10.530 --> 00:11.490
Um...

00:11.780 --> 00:12.990
It was you?!

00:13.410 --> 00:15.070
Anyway, eat up!

00:15.070 --> 00:17.540
No, I have my own lunch...

00:17.540 --> 00:21.230
Could you at least have a bite?

00:21.230 --> 00:24.500
I worked hard to make this
for you to enjoy.

00:24.590 --> 00:25.760
CRACK

00:25.760 --> 00:28.150
You should accept Himari's feelings!

00:28.150 --> 00:30.240
You're not going anywhere now!

00:30.240 --> 00:32.640
All right, I'll eat.

00:33.890 --> 00:37.020
Thanks! Here comes the aeroplane!

00:39.400 --> 00:41.420
Whoa...!

00:41.420 --> 00:44.270
It looked raw at first,
but it's actually cooked!

00:44.270 --> 00:45.290
So good.

00:45.290 --> 00:46.530
Glad to hear that!

00:46.890 --> 00:47.310
Here.

00:47.310 --> 00:49.080
I can eat the rest myself.

00:49.080 --> 00:51.160
Come on, don't be shy.

00:53.300 --> 00:55.600
I feel like a chick now.

00:55.600 --> 00:57.680
So I'm your mom, then?

00:57.680 --> 00:59.660
That's not too bad!

00:59.660 --> 01:03.050
If you brought your own lunch,
then eat that first!

01:03.050 --> 01:05.800
Akane, are you perhaps jealous?

01:05.800 --> 01:08.030
Huh?! Wh-Wh-What are you talking about?!

01:08.030 --> 01:12.050
N-N-N-No way I'm j-j-j-j-j-j-j-jealous...

01:12.050 --> 01:15.400
Don't worry, I love you too.

01:15.400 --> 01:16.400
Himari...

01:16.900 --> 01:18.620
Now, Akane...

01:18.620 --> 01:20.100
Open your mouth...

01:20.510 --> 01:23.750
It's too embarrassing to do this
in front of people...

01:25.330 --> 01:27.160
What are we witnessing here?

01:27.740 --> 01:31.990
So good... Meat... Tasty!

01:36.370 --> 01:37.740
I'M GETTING MARRIED TO A GIRL

01:37.740 --> 01:39.330
I HATE IN MY CLASS

01:39.330 --> 01:42.330
I'M GETTING MARRIED TO A GIRL
I HATE IN MY CLASS

02:55.950 --> 03:01.950
I'M GETTING MARRIED TO A GIRL
I HATE IN MY CLASS

03:01.950 --> 03:03.170
#6 FIRST DATE OF A MARRIED COUPLE

03:03.170 --> 03:05.920
#6 FIRST DATE OF A MARRIED COUPLE
Hey, so you're our year's top scorer, right?

03:06.230 --> 03:09.150
I can't keep up with maths these days...

03:09.150 --> 03:11.400
Could you teach me?

03:11.400 --> 03:12.920
Sure, I don't mind.

03:12.920 --> 03:15.650
Then, let's study together at my place!

03:15.650 --> 03:16.840
Your place?

03:17.250 --> 03:21.260
Our parents aren't home today,
so we'll be all alone.

03:21.260 --> 03:23.160
- Alone!
- Don't tease me so much.

03:23.160 --> 03:25.300
I'm not. I'm being serious here.

03:25.300 --> 03:27.370
But I turned down the date, right?

03:27.370 --> 03:30.520
I told you, I'll keep trying
until you fall for me.

03:32.020 --> 03:35.040
Or are you scared?

03:35.040 --> 03:37.410
That you might start liking me...

03:37.410 --> 03:38.790
Hey!

03:38.790 --> 03:39.670
What's up?

03:39.670 --> 03:44.630
Um, well... It's dangerous
to be alone with him.

03:44.630 --> 03:46.790
He'll definitely do something weird to you...

03:46.790 --> 03:49.270
You're more than welcome!

03:49.270 --> 03:51.540
You should cherish yourself more!

03:51.540 --> 03:52.920
Don't be deceived by him!

03:52.920 --> 03:55.530
Let your guard down,
and you'll regret it down the road,

03:55.530 --> 03:57.930
then you'll have to get
married unhappily as a student!

03:57.930 --> 03:58.930
Ugh!

04:00.080 --> 04:02.590
No way a student could get married.

04:02.590 --> 04:03.930
Anyway!

04:03.930 --> 04:06.680
You can't be alone together!
That's unhealthy!

04:06.680 --> 04:09.180
Then, you tag along too!

04:09.180 --> 04:09.850
Huh?

04:09.850 --> 04:14.110
I think I can get to the third rank
if the top scorer and the runner up teach me!

04:14.520 --> 04:16.490
I mean, 1+2=3!

04:16.880 --> 04:18.330
What's up with that calculation?

04:18.330 --> 04:19.650
It's all wrong in every aspect.

04:19.650 --> 04:23.370
Who is the insolent fool
aiming for the third rank?

04:23.370 --> 04:24.820
Since when were you here?!

04:24.820 --> 04:28.000
Oh, right. You've always been third
in our year, huh?

04:28.350 --> 04:31.810
If you teach me as well, Shisei,
that means 1+2+3...

04:32.130 --> 04:34.660
Which means I'll be sixth in our year!

04:34.660 --> 04:36.610
That's way lower than before!
Is that okay?!

04:36.610 --> 04:38.630
I can do multiplications, mind you!

04:39.400 --> 04:42.070
The four of us should study together!

04:43.000 --> 04:44.430
Let's do it at Akane's!

04:44.430 --> 04:45.390
Huh?!

04:45.890 --> 04:47.390
W-Welcome!

04:47.390 --> 04:48.600
Heya!

04:48.600 --> 04:50.390
SAITO'S BELONGINGS
Pardon the intrusion.

04:50.390 --> 04:51.190
HIGH SCHOOL ENGLISH GRAMMAR

04:51.190 --> 04:53.110
So, what should I teach you?

04:53.500 --> 04:54.990
Which part don't you know?

04:54.990 --> 04:56.650
Um...

04:56.650 --> 04:59.660
I don't even know what I don't know!

05:00.940 --> 05:02.570
Let's rephrase.

05:02.570 --> 05:04.940
Since when couldn't you keep up with class?

05:04.940 --> 05:06.960
Since first year of grade school?

05:06.960 --> 05:08.910
Right from 1+1 era?!

05:08.910 --> 05:13.920
I guess she's starting to fail her maths class
since our first spring of high school?

05:13.920 --> 05:17.830
You may be right!
Wow, you're so observant of me!

05:17.830 --> 05:20.300
I mean, we're friends...

05:20.620 --> 05:23.500
You-mean-best-friend! Right?

05:23.500 --> 05:25.430
We're best friends...

05:25.750 --> 05:28.440
All right, let's reteach you first year's maths.

05:32.690 --> 05:35.090
W-Wow! Even I can solve it!

05:35.090 --> 05:37.690
Saito, you're so good at teaching!

05:37.690 --> 05:38.480
You think so?

05:38.480 --> 05:42.110
Yeah! Better than our teachers at school!
Right, Akane?

05:42.110 --> 05:45.330
I guess he's pretty good,
but compared to me,

05:45.330 --> 05:46.580
he's still a cheeky novice!

05:46.860 --> 05:47.820
Chicky?

05:47.820 --> 05:51.080
Cheeky! I'm saying he's still
got so much to learn!

05:51.080 --> 05:51.990
We're the same age...

05:51.990 --> 05:53.780
You really are a genius, Saito!

05:53.780 --> 05:55.590
Amazing! Teach me more!

05:55.930 --> 05:57.040
Hey...

05:57.040 --> 05:58.600
What's wrong?

05:58.600 --> 06:01.040
Don't play dumb.
You know it...

06:03.760 --> 06:04.130
HUG

06:04.130 --> 06:05.950
Cousin, I'm bored.

06:05.950 --> 06:10.240
Stop studying and humour me now.

06:10.240 --> 06:12.230
Let's take a break for now.

06:13.210 --> 06:14.980
Why are we playing concentration?

06:15.320 --> 06:17.290
I told you, we're taking a break.

06:17.290 --> 06:19.860
I can have fun with anything.

06:20.130 --> 06:22.860
I want to play against you, Cousin.

06:22.860 --> 06:26.170
I'll thoroughly beat Saito in this!

06:26.170 --> 06:27.990
Man, we've got
a soon-to-be murderer here.

06:30.870 --> 06:32.070
SAITO'S COMPLETE WIN
Oh, right.

06:32.070 --> 06:35.530
SAITO'S COMPLETE WIN
I forgot I couldn't win against him in this.

06:35.530 --> 06:37.750
SAITO'S COMPLETE WIN
Um, want a rematch?

06:38.110 --> 06:38.630
Nah.

06:39.230 --> 06:41.880
I'll go get us something sweet.

06:42.230 --> 06:43.880
You three can continue playing.

06:49.410 --> 06:51.390
Why are you following me?

06:51.700 --> 06:54.390
I'm watching you so you won't quit
while winning ahead.

06:54.840 --> 06:55.900
Really?

06:55.900 --> 06:59.650
Your memory is also outstanding
outside of studying, huh?

07:00.810 --> 07:02.060
Disgusting, isn't it?

07:02.400 --> 07:03.080
Huh?

07:03.730 --> 07:05.320
I can tell myself.

07:05.710 --> 07:08.660
This memory is disgusting.

07:09.100 --> 07:13.030
We Hojos have a few screws loose inside.

07:13.560 --> 07:16.280
Shisei can do extensive
mental arithmetic instantly.

07:16.280 --> 07:18.670
As for me, it's my memory that's too strong.

07:19.070 --> 07:21.340
So you have a lineage of geniuses?

07:21.340 --> 07:24.610
Since I memorise too much
of someone's personal details,

07:24.610 --> 07:26.680
I used to be shunned by those around me.

07:26.680 --> 07:29.100
I was once treated like a stalker too.

07:29.100 --> 07:32.980
You remembered the favourite thing
I wrote in the anthology too, after all.

07:35.470 --> 07:37.690
I'm kind of jealous.

07:38.980 --> 07:43.470
I mean, with such strong memory,
you don't have to study much.

07:43.470 --> 07:46.840
If you can remember the things
your partner likes and hates,

07:46.840 --> 07:48.700
you can be considerate of them.

07:53.080 --> 07:54.970
You? Considerate?

07:54.970 --> 07:59.710
How rude! I'm not fighting you because
I like it! I'll throw you to Tokyo Bay!

08:00.420 --> 08:03.110
Shisei! It went over there!

08:03.110 --> 08:03.960
Fire!

08:05.810 --> 08:08.590
What are you two doing...

08:08.590 --> 08:09.950
Oh, welcome back!

08:09.950 --> 08:12.220
- So you bought this kind of game, huh!
- Fire!

08:12.620 --> 08:15.760
It's my dad who bought it...

08:15.760 --> 08:17.980
Why didn't you save the game console?

08:17.980 --> 08:19.850
I didn't have enough time...

08:19.850 --> 08:22.340
Come on, that's enough break!

08:22.340 --> 08:24.860
I've bought some sweets,
so let's have some tea!

08:25.430 --> 08:28.160
Cousin, cool the tea for me.

08:28.160 --> 08:29.990
Do it yourself.

08:29.990 --> 08:31.340
Thanks for today.

08:31.340 --> 08:34.830
Because of you,
I could understand a bit about maths.

08:34.830 --> 08:35.930
Glad to hear that.

08:35.930 --> 08:38.740
You still have much room to improve.
It'll be worth teaching you.

08:38.740 --> 08:41.000
Really? In that case...

08:41.340 --> 08:43.770
What if we study at your place next?

08:44.510 --> 08:46.480
We can't do that...

08:46.480 --> 08:47.510
Why?

08:47.880 --> 08:49.870
Any reason why I can't come over?

08:49.870 --> 08:51.040
That's...

08:51.040 --> 08:53.760
Oh, you're blushing!
So cute!

08:54.510 --> 08:56.140
Hang on, I'll get the wiping cloth!

08:57.190 --> 08:58.010
Here.

08:58.010 --> 08:59.310
Oh, thanks.

08:59.310 --> 09:01.900
But, how did you know it was there?

09:01.900 --> 09:03.020
Gulp!

09:03.020 --> 09:04.150
Hmm?

09:04.150 --> 09:07.280
Just my gut feeling...

09:07.280 --> 09:10.370
Wow, you really are amazing!

09:10.370 --> 09:15.180
Anyway, you'll stain your uniform,
so you'd better wash it at the restroom.

09:15.180 --> 09:17.410
I'll do that. Which way is it?

09:17.710 --> 09:19.730
I'll show you.

09:20.200 --> 09:23.110
You made such a careless mistake
because you were swooned by Himari.

09:23.110 --> 09:24.370
I wasn't!

09:24.370 --> 09:27.550
You were! You got beet red
when Himari clung to you!

09:27.550 --> 09:30.250
It's all because you tutored her!

09:30.250 --> 09:31.550
What else do you want me to do?

09:31.550 --> 09:34.700
You never even once tutored me.

09:34.700 --> 09:38.340
You're the one who refused
my help when I was about to.

09:38.340 --> 09:42.440
Yeah, you're my nemesis, after all!
I'll defeat you with my...

09:44.130 --> 09:45.560
The power's just out.

09:45.950 --> 09:48.290
Always a scaredy-cat, aren't you?

09:48.290 --> 09:49.790
I'm not!

09:49.790 --> 09:51.160
But you're screaming...

09:51.160 --> 09:52.570
I'm not!

09:52.900 --> 09:54.820
Anyway, I'll go look at the breaker.

09:54.820 --> 09:57.820
Don't leave me in this scary place!

09:57.820 --> 09:58.830
But it's your home!

10:02.050 --> 10:03.830
I guess...

10:04.260 --> 10:06.310
Guys do prefer girls who are honest...

10:06.750 --> 10:08.750
Why do you say that?

10:08.750 --> 10:09.960
No reason...

10:12.360 --> 10:15.090
You can just be yourself.

10:16.350 --> 10:18.990
We're not talking about me...

10:18.990 --> 10:22.570
I'm not talking about you either.
It's about Girl A.

10:23.200 --> 10:24.920
That sounds like a criminal...

10:24.920 --> 10:28.260
She's an obstinate,
hardworking, and shy girl.

10:28.260 --> 10:32.760
She's never honest with herself,
but she doesn't mean harm.

10:32.760 --> 10:36.030
In fact, she wishes for people
to be happy more than anyone.

10:36.030 --> 10:40.810
She's a hassle to deal with, but recently,
I'm starting to figure out what's on her mind.

10:40.810 --> 10:42.750
That's too much...

10:43.070 --> 10:45.780
Even her most troublesome side,
second to none in this world...

10:46.300 --> 10:48.220
I don't hate it.

10:48.220 --> 10:50.880
What do you mean second to none
in the world...

10:51.450 --> 10:52.440
Silly...

10:54.510 --> 10:57.270
That spooked me!
Who knew the power would be out?

10:57.270 --> 10:58.140
Oh!

11:00.470 --> 11:01.520
So you're close?

11:01.520 --> 11:03.770
We're not!

11:04.230 --> 11:08.020
So, we couldn't figure out why only
our house's power was out.

11:08.540 --> 11:10.020
Did you do that?

11:10.380 --> 11:12.150
I didn't do that.

11:12.150 --> 11:16.600
Saito! I couldn't understand
some of the lesson earlier!

11:16.600 --> 11:18.650
Could you teach me again?

11:18.650 --> 11:21.750
It's good to have
a high amount of curiosity.

11:21.750 --> 11:24.160
You should have him teach you too, Akane!

11:24.160 --> 11:27.830
I'm good. I've never been
tutored by that guy too.

11:27.830 --> 11:30.090
THAT GUY
You always say something like that, huh?

11:30.090 --> 11:31.150
You always say something like that, huh?

11:31.590 --> 11:35.220
You'd better tutor me
when we're home, okay?

11:41.640 --> 11:42.770
Amazing!

11:42.770 --> 11:45.270
MAX VOCABULARY MUSCLES 30K WORDS
I can keep memorising without having to write!

11:45.270 --> 11:46.490
Right?

11:47.210 --> 11:50.240
Your method alone is worth my praise.

11:50.240 --> 11:52.700
It's not mine.

11:52.700 --> 11:54.780
I don't even study either.

11:54.780 --> 11:56.490
MAX VOCABULARY MUSCLES 30K WORDS
Then, what is this?

11:56.490 --> 11:58.230
MAX VOCABULARY MUSCLES 30K WORDS
It's a study method

11:58.230 --> 11:59.530
MAX VOCABULARY MUSCLES 30K WORDS
I thought out as an experiment.

12:00.050 --> 12:04.370
I've tried it on many people,
but your case seemed most effective.

12:04.720 --> 12:06.660
I guess you're already smart from the get-go.

12:06.660 --> 12:07.540
MAX VOCABULARY MUSCLES 30K WORDS
What?!

12:07.870 --> 12:09.790
It's late, so that's all for today.

12:09.790 --> 12:12.560
We're not sleeping today!
There's still 8 hours until morning!

12:12.560 --> 12:14.330
Go to bed! You'll get sick again!

12:14.330 --> 12:15.570
No way!

12:17.330 --> 12:20.320
Why do you want to study so hard?

12:20.320 --> 12:23.490
I told you before.
I want to be a doctor.

12:23.490 --> 12:26.930
My question is why you want to be a doctor.

12:27.280 --> 12:29.190
It doesn't concern you.

12:29.190 --> 12:33.190
No, it doesn't, but I want to know...

12:33.950 --> 12:35.190
...about you.

12:36.430 --> 12:38.200
Why?

12:38.630 --> 12:41.210
No reason. Just curious.

12:44.200 --> 12:46.010
When I was little...

12:46.490 --> 12:48.490
I had a little sister.

12:48.970 --> 12:50.080
Little sister?

12:50.600 --> 12:54.920
She was so frail,
so she was bedridden.

12:54.920 --> 12:59.670
My parents worked so hard
to get money for her medication,

12:59.670 --> 13:01.930
and they were rarely home.

13:01.930 --> 13:05.400
So that's why you're so good
at housework and cooking?

13:06.830 --> 13:11.920
I could only watch in silence
as she was suffering.

13:12.340 --> 13:15.310
Even when she cried to me for help,

13:15.310 --> 13:18.080
I could do nothing but pat her head.

13:18.910 --> 13:21.630
I was so frustrated...

13:22.310 --> 13:23.870
I couldn't forgive myself.

13:24.440 --> 13:26.870
So that's why you want to be a doctor?

13:27.180 --> 13:32.370
I couldn't save my sister, but there's
a lot people out there still suffering.

13:32.370 --> 13:36.360
I want to do what I can
so no one will die.

13:37.030 --> 13:39.880
I want power enough to save people.

13:40.440 --> 13:41.600
Where's your sister?

13:42.150 --> 13:43.640
She's not around anymore.

13:44.520 --> 13:47.090
She's already somewhere far away.

13:49.890 --> 13:52.110
The little sister idols
are on the rage these days!

13:52.110 --> 13:54.840
All the big brothers
are fascinated by their charm...

13:55.370 --> 13:57.550
What's up? You're not into idols?

13:57.550 --> 14:00.650
No, I don't hate nor like them.

14:01.160 --> 14:02.720
You sure have it nice...

14:02.720 --> 14:05.830
Having such a little sister
like Shisei around.

14:05.830 --> 14:10.190
I would've actually gone shopping,
eaten meals, and watched a movie together,

14:10.190 --> 14:12.140
were she my little sister.

14:12.800 --> 14:14.170
Akane...

14:14.170 --> 14:17.920
So, what is it you want to talk about, Cousin?

14:17.920 --> 14:21.040
Akane's not feeling cheerful these days.

14:21.040 --> 14:23.330
I'm thinking about what I should do.

14:23.330 --> 14:26.870
You want to cheer her up?
Is this love?

14:26.870 --> 14:30.930
It's just suffocating to see
my roommate so gloomy.

14:31.590 --> 14:35.320
I heard from her that
she lost her sister years ago.

14:35.320 --> 14:37.520
It's because I reminded her of that.

14:38.020 --> 14:40.290
It's on me.
I want to do something about it.

14:40.670 --> 14:45.260
I'll be happy if you hang out with me.
We could go shopping, for instance.

14:45.260 --> 14:47.450
We always go shopping together, though?

14:47.830 --> 14:49.760
I don't think that's the case.

14:49.760 --> 14:53.150
Though, anywhere is fun
as long as I'm with you.

14:54.580 --> 14:56.800
I guess the super cheap supermarket
would be fun?

14:56.800 --> 14:57.710
0 points.

14:58.480 --> 15:02.510
She may not realise it herself,
but she's a true maiden.

15:02.510 --> 15:06.640
She'll be happy by the sight
of glamorous stores or sweets shops.

15:07.090 --> 15:08.210
Akane?

15:08.210 --> 15:09.890
ROAAAR
A maiden?

15:09.890 --> 15:13.830
To rehearse,
you will have to invite me now.

15:13.830 --> 15:14.390
Huh?

15:14.390 --> 15:16.690
BUFFET SWEETS FAIR FROM AROUND THE WORLD
Right now, there's a buffet

15:16.690 --> 15:19.070
BUFFET SWEETS FAIR FROM AROUND THE WORLD
sweets fair from around the world!

15:19.070 --> 15:21.150
BUFFET SWEETS FAIR FROM AROUND THE WORLD
That's your aim here?

15:23.430 --> 15:25.530
Want to hang out next weekend?

15:25.530 --> 15:26.530
Huh?!

15:26.530 --> 15:30.290
Why me?!
You should ask Shisei for that, right?!

15:30.290 --> 15:32.410
Do you not like movies?

15:32.410 --> 15:35.720
We could go to the sweets shop after...

15:35.720 --> 15:37.070
Sweets shop!

15:37.070 --> 15:39.290
Anyway, let's hang out together.

15:40.970 --> 15:42.670
Hey, the curry...

15:43.300 --> 15:45.020
It's okay...

15:45.020 --> 15:46.180
But it's burnt...

15:46.180 --> 15:49.180
Not the curry!
I mean the hangout!

15:49.180 --> 15:50.680
SWEETS CAFE

15:50.680 --> 15:52.810
Did something happen
with you and Saito?

15:52.810 --> 15:53.650
Huh?

15:53.650 --> 15:58.330
Tell me anything.
I'm sure I can help.

15:59.020 --> 16:02.820
Saito asked me to hang out together...

16:03.260 --> 16:05.690
Could this be a date?

16:05.690 --> 16:06.380
Finally...

16:06.380 --> 16:07.510
Grandma?!

16:07.510 --> 16:10.650
You're finally getting together with him...

16:10.650 --> 16:14.330
Now I won't have any regrets
even if I die...

16:14.330 --> 16:15.580
Please live long!

16:15.580 --> 16:18.310
If that's the case,
then leave it to me!

16:18.310 --> 16:20.960
I knew this would happen,
so I came prepared!

16:20.960 --> 16:22.480
BAM
What's this place?

16:22.480 --> 16:24.890
BAM
Your exclusive dressing room.

16:24.890 --> 16:25.670
BAM
I've been stocking on some clothes

16:25.670 --> 16:26.860
I've been stocking on some clothes

16:26.860 --> 16:28.410
for when my cute Akane falls in love.

16:28.410 --> 16:29.930
I haven't fallen in love!

16:29.930 --> 16:31.720
Maybe we should start from the underwear?

16:31.720 --> 16:34.850
Take a look at all
kinds of exotic underwear!

16:34.850 --> 16:36.230
I don't need it!

16:36.230 --> 16:40.350
I guess it'd be too stimulating
if you went commando on your first date...

16:40.350 --> 16:41.860
I'll still wear some underwear!

16:43.000 --> 16:44.230
Thanks for waiting.

16:49.300 --> 16:50.930
Wh-What?

16:50.930 --> 16:55.000
Oh, nothing...
I see you're going all out today.

16:55.000 --> 16:57.420
My grandma just forced me to wear this!

16:57.420 --> 16:59.450
She said it's our precious date, after all!

16:59.450 --> 17:00.940
R-Really...

17:01.290 --> 17:05.670
Of course, I know this isn't a date!
I mean, a married couple can't have a date!

17:05.670 --> 17:09.170
You're right, it's definitely not.

17:09.170 --> 17:10.050
HARAKYO STATION

17:10.050 --> 17:10.930
PHARMACY

17:12.180 --> 17:12.880
CAT CAFE

17:12.880 --> 17:14.140
CAT CAFE
Want to go to the cat cafe?

17:14.140 --> 17:15.640
Not this one!

17:15.640 --> 17:16.970
But you love cats, don't you?

17:16.970 --> 17:18.990
I got banned from this place.

17:18.990 --> 17:20.690
What did you even do?!

17:20.690 --> 17:24.350
I petted the cat
I liked most too much there...

17:24.350 --> 17:27.190
Yeah, you're the type that
can't hit the brakes, after all.

17:27.190 --> 17:30.800
Cat, cat, cat...

17:30.800 --> 17:32.680
Okay, get out of there now.

17:32.680 --> 17:35.650
No! My cats!

17:35.650 --> 17:36.950
Not yours!

17:36.950 --> 17:37.950
JOYCOLOUR

17:38.950 --> 17:42.230
You're luring me into a secret place
to do lecherous things with me, huh?!

17:42.230 --> 17:45.340
But we're living in a secret place every day!
What could happen now?!

17:45.340 --> 17:47.580
Himari told me.

17:47.580 --> 17:50.090
When a boy and a girl
go to the karaoke on a date,

17:50.090 --> 17:52.330
SMOOCH
th-they'll definitely smooch each other!

17:52.330 --> 17:54.590
SMOOCH
It's not definitely! Also, we're not on a date!

17:54.900 --> 17:56.790
Anyway, I'll get some songs playing.

17:56.790 --> 17:59.220
Yeah, I'll put in some too.

17:59.220 --> 18:00.120
BEYOND LOVE AND HATE

18:00.120 --> 18:02.030
BEYOND LOVE AND HATE
I just chose a song Himari

18:02.030 --> 18:03.410
BEYOND LOVE AND HATE
would choose out of habit.

18:03.410 --> 18:04.980
BEYOND LOVE AND HATE
I know this one.

18:05.400 --> 18:06.740
Want to duet?

18:06.740 --> 18:08.480
Yes, please.

18:23.650 --> 18:26.000
Wow, that's so refreshing!

18:26.420 --> 18:31.370
We may not be suited for each other,
but our voices sure complement each other.

18:31.770 --> 18:34.630
We've sung a lot,
so I want to take it easy now.

18:34.630 --> 18:38.260
In that case, I know a good place.
Want to stop by?

18:40.880 --> 18:42.390
It's so good!

18:42.390 --> 18:44.320
It tastes just like strawberry!

18:44.320 --> 18:47.110
The owner should be made
a living national treasure!

18:47.110 --> 18:48.410
That's too much compliment.

18:48.410 --> 18:51.870
That's just how great it is!
You should have a taste too!

18:51.870 --> 18:54.400
It'll be an indirect kiss, though?
Are you sure?

18:54.400 --> 18:57.030
No, you can't have it, pervert!

18:57.410 --> 18:59.000
You suggested it yourself...

18:59.000 --> 18:59.790
Ugh...

19:00.160 --> 19:01.540
A-All right...

19:02.090 --> 19:04.540
Just a sip, okay?

19:05.290 --> 19:08.460
It's your favourite drink,
so drink it yourself.

19:10.600 --> 19:12.900
Why did you ask me out?

19:13.320 --> 19:14.440
Just because.

19:14.440 --> 19:18.050
There must be a reason, right?
Considering you're a pragmatist.

19:20.490 --> 19:21.560
Well...

19:22.040 --> 19:24.900
Since I made you recall your sister,

19:24.900 --> 19:26.440
you'd been feeling down.

19:29.510 --> 19:33.940
So you asked me out to cheer me up?

19:34.280 --> 19:36.660
Frankly speaking, yes...

19:40.050 --> 19:41.830
What?

19:44.640 --> 19:47.960
As a token of gratitude
I'll follow you anywhere...

19:48.580 --> 19:50.090
...you want to go.

19:50.750 --> 19:51.900
Anywhere?

19:52.660 --> 19:56.060
The only supplement store in the country
that specialises in sampling!

19:57.090 --> 19:59.090
Want a sample, Mister?

19:59.090 --> 20:00.290
I'll have some.

20:01.840 --> 20:03.430
Wow, this vitamin B rocks!

20:03.430 --> 20:05.180
You're not talking about the supplement!

20:05.680 --> 20:08.760
Oh, so you did your homework, Mister?

20:08.760 --> 20:10.360
Have some of this too.

20:10.360 --> 20:13.980
- The calcium is coming to my bones!
- Come back to Earth, Saito!

20:13.980 --> 20:17.400
We also have the newly developed protein!

20:17.400 --> 20:18.950
Want to try?

20:19.310 --> 20:23.080
Allow me. I'm training to drink
supplements without water.

20:23.080 --> 20:26.220
Powder! Such absolute powder!

20:26.220 --> 20:26.890
I don't think

20:26.890 --> 20:30.330
- I can go back to the usual protein!
- Saito!

20:30.850 --> 20:33.210
Gosh, that was stupid...

20:37.210 --> 20:38.510
Want one?

20:38.510 --> 20:39.720
Not really.

20:39.720 --> 20:42.300
A ring would only get in the way of cooking!

20:42.300 --> 20:44.520
You could just buy it
if you want.

20:44.520 --> 20:47.050
Not happening.
Look at the price tag.

20:47.050 --> 20:49.310
You're right. It's too steep.

20:49.770 --> 20:52.790
It's not something a student can afford.

20:52.790 --> 20:57.570
I'll buy it when I've grown up
and can earn enough to live a fulfilling life.

20:57.920 --> 20:59.570
Will it still be here by then?

20:59.570 --> 21:02.990
It will! Or else,
I'll curse the tenants and customers!

21:02.990 --> 21:04.890
Don't curse innocent people.

21:07.710 --> 21:09.250
Thanks for today.

21:09.250 --> 21:09.960
Huh?

21:10.730 --> 21:13.590
Now I'm all cheered up.

21:14.730 --> 21:17.960
Good grief... You look like
a demon when angry...

21:19.070 --> 21:20.120
What a waste.

21:20.820 --> 21:22.970
You could've just smiled all the time.

21:25.390 --> 21:27.370
Isn't the ring in the way?

21:27.830 --> 21:30.040
Not at all?

21:30.040 --> 21:32.670
Doesn't it hurt to wear it every day?

21:32.670 --> 21:35.860
It was made with my finger
size in mind, so it doesn't.

21:36.190 --> 21:39.610
You see, a ring is someone's feelings of love.

21:39.610 --> 21:40.860
Feelings?

21:41.240 --> 21:44.880
Your dad thought of me so dearly,

21:44.880 --> 21:47.680
and had chosen me as his life partner.

21:48.610 --> 21:52.780
No matter what, we'll always be
together through our feelings.

21:52.780 --> 21:56.880
If I wear this ring,
my heart feels warmer.

21:57.490 --> 21:59.250
I'm sure you'll understand someday,

21:59.250 --> 22:04.010
when the person you want to be
together with comes to your life.

23:34.930 --> 23:40.900
#7 RING
